<https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/RelationshipType/follows> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The to Element succeeds the from Element, establishing a unidirectional sequence. This succession is defined as chronological, procedural, or logical. It is used to represent either a temporal order (e.g., in a workflow) or a logical order for processing and traversal (e.g., in an ordered list)."@en .
