<https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Hardware/hazard> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "Hazards are potential sources of harm, danger, or adverse effects to people, property, the environment, or systems within or related to a specific piece of hardware. For example, a lithium battery is a hazardous hardware item."@en .
<https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/ExternalIdentifierType/eli> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "European Legislation Identifier (ELI) <https://eur-lex.europa.eu/content/help/eurlex-content/eli.html> is a Uniform Resource Identifier (URI) that uniquely identifies a legal resource, typically consisting of a document type, adoption year, and document number (e.g., http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg/2024/2847/oj)."@en .
_:Nabe53a0396d84777b9b4c406fbbb698c <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#not> _:Nc9825d76f3ac47cabba86a6c5694e0da .
